## Required Handoff

Provide via `kanban_complete(summary=..., metadata={{...}})`:

- changed_files: [paths relative to repo root]
- verification:  [exact command(s) run + outcome]
- dependencies:  [added/removed deps, or "none"]
- branch_head:   [commit SHA of the worker branch]
- residual_risk: [known unknowns, or "none known"]
